{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A non-zero digit is chosen in such a way that the probability of choosing digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e9c39289f87fde1b318eeb923d25879ed66df2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{(d+1)}-\\log_{10}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />. The probability that the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is chosen is exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f3cc0ad966b3e637cd199607cbf0d1befc0e491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> the probability that the digit chosen is in the set\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4de2ea13eecb18cc7397b997b8690e12ab581aa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\{2,3\\} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\{3,4\\} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\{4,5,6,7,8\\} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\{5,6,7,8,9\\} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\{4,5,6,7,8,9\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"693\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/58879e153f0e9e5ea622c6a1584143da246929dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{(d+1)}-\\log_{10}{d} = \\log_{10}{\\left(\\frac{d+1}{d}\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"305\" height=\"45\" />, so the probability of choosing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24a30b04faf3d95c22d55a367f97894e862516dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"82\" height=\"45\" />. The probability that the digit chosen is in the set must therefore be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abeaf37f79746f0067da68bceb3f4b8a2cf30c89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}2\\log_{10}{\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)} = &amp;\\log_{10}{\\left(\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^2\\right)} \\\\ = &amp;\\log_{10}{\\left(\\frac{9}{4}\\right)} \\\\ = &amp;\\log_{10}{9}-\\log_{10}{4} \\\\ = &amp;\\left(\\log_{10}{9}-\\log_{10}{8}\\right)+\\left(\\log_{10}{8}-\\log_{10}{7}\\right)+\\left(\\log_{10}{7}-\\log_{10}{6}\\right) \\\\ &amp;+\\left(\\log_{10}{6}-\\log_{10}{5}\\right)+\\left(\\log_{10}{5}-\\log_{10}{4}\\right),\\end{align*}\" width=\"563\" height=\"178\" />\nwhich, by definition, is the probability that the digit chosen is in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77db36cac1e985561143a8b0432f50138b3ec0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\ \\{4,5,6,7,8\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\